{"ticker":"KO","updated":"2026-10-23T23:12:43Z","profile":{"longName":"The Coca-Cola Company","shortName":"Coca-Cola Company (The)","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Beverages - Non-Alcoholic","country":"United States","website":"https://www.coca-colacompany.com","fullTimeEmployees":65900,"marketCap":398889320448,"trailingPE":27.840841,"forwardPE":26.30623,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":7.957257,"pegRatio":4.33,"targetMeanPrice":95.33333,"targetHighPrice":104.0,"targetLowPrice":80.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.067,"earningsGrowth":0.169,"grossMargins":0.61888003,"operatingMargins":0.34873,"profitMargins":0.28558,"totalRevenue":50128998400,"beta":0.318,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":95.37,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":67.27,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.22},"summary":"The Coca-Cola Company, a beverage company, manufactures and sells various nonalcoholic beverages in the United States and internationally. The company provides Trademark Coca-Cola, sparkling soft drinks and flavors; water, sports, coffee, and tea; juice, value-added dairy, and plant-based beverages; and emerging beverages. It also offers beverage concentrates and syrups, as well as fountain syrups to fountain retailers comprising restaurants and convenience stores. The company sells its products under the Coca-Cola, Diet Coke/Coca-Cola Light, Coca-Cola Zero Sugar, caffeine free Diet Coke, Cherry Coke, Fanta, Sprite, Simply, Fanta Orange, Fanta Zero Orange, Fanta Zero Sugar, Fanta Apple, Sprite Zero Sugar, Simply Orange, Simply Apple, Simply Grapefruit, Fresca, Schweppes, Thums Up, Aquarius, Ayataka, BODYARMOR, Ciel, Costa, Crystal, Dasani, Fuze Tea, Georgia, glacéau smartwater, glacéau vitaminwater, Gold Peak, I LOHAS, Powerade, Topo Chico, Core Power, Del Valle, fairlife, innocent, Maaza, Minute Maid, Minute Maid Pulpy, Santa Clara, and dogadan brands. It operates through a network of independent bottling partners, distributors, wholesalers, and retailers, as well as through bottling and distribution operators. The Coca-Cola Company was founded in 1886 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","summary_zh":"可口可樂公司是一家飲料公司，在美國和國際上生產和銷售各種非酒精飲料。該公司提供商標可口可樂、氣泡軟性飲料和香料；水、運動、咖啡和茶；果汁、加值乳製品和植物性飲料；和新興飲料。它還向包括餐廳和便利商店在內的飲水機零售商提供濃縮飲料和糖漿以及飲水機糖漿。該公司以可口可樂、健怡可樂/淡味可口可樂、零糖可口可樂、無咖啡因健怡可樂、櫻桃可樂、芬達、雪碧、Simply、芬達橙、芬達零橙、芬達零糖、芬達蘋果、雪碧零糖、Simply Orange、Simply Apple、Simply Grapea、芬達蘋果、雪碧零糖、Simply Orange、Simply Apple、Simply Grapepeuit、Fresca、Schadm、Aama、AotA、MrDY Ciel、Costa、Crystal、Dasani、Fuze Tea、Georgia、glacéau smartwater、glacéau Vitaminwater、Gold Peak、I LOHAS、Powerade、Topo Chico、Core Power、Del Valle、fairlife、innocent、Maazaa、Minute Maid、Minute Maid Pulpy、Santa Clarid Pulpy、Santa Clara 和 Dog Maid 品牌。它透過獨立裝瓶合作夥伴、分銷商、批發商和零售商以及裝瓶和分銷運營商組成的網路進行運營。可口可樂公司成立於 1886 年，總部位於喬治亞州亞特蘭大。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"飲料 - 非酒精類","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":70.11,"h":70.23,"l":68.72,"c":68.93,"v":13634600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":69.04,"h":69.08,"l":68.58,"c":68.73,"v":17964200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":68.82,"h":68.87,"l":68.47,"c":68.83,"v":11562700},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":68.88,"h":68.9,"l":68.28,"c":68.36,"v":16209900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":68.67,"h":69.14,"l":68.43,"c":68.99,"v":14601100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":68.96,"h":69.34,"l":68.26,"c":69.06,"v":24770100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":68.66,"h":69.1,"l":67.37,"c":68.99,"v":33581500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":69.11,"h":69.46,"l":68.11,"c":68.25,"v":16736000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":68.01,"h":68.58,"l":67.87,"c":67.96,"v":23978000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":67.86,"h":67.88,"l":67.16,"c":67.43,"v":21671700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":67.28,"h":68.11,"l":67.28,"c":67.86,"v":14120600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":67.79,"h":68.09,"l":67.21,"c":67.82,"v":16041900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":67.92,"h":68.17,"l":67.58,"c":67.62,"v":15128700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":67.6,"h":67.72,"l":66.94,"c":67.01,"v":18712400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":66.68,"h":66.78,"l":66.1,"c":66.21,"v":15986100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":66.35,"h":66.51,"l